      "summary": "The assistant can change an application it wrote for the person: `apps.read` gives it with a revision (refused with `OS0161` for any module not written for the person), and `apps.revise` offers a new version in the inbox against that revision, refused with `OS0112` when the application changed since, both when offered and when accepted. Accepted, the new version replaces the application, still asking for nothing, and its windows start again on it.",
      "id": "app-revisions"
    }
  ],
